(text "J3 pad numbers are A-board labels, not vendor connector geometry.\n1 BLACK GND / 2 RED 5V / 3 GREEN MISO\n4 YELLOW MOSI / 5 BLUE CLK / 6 WHITE CSn\n5V supply, 3V3 SPI logic. Mode 1, initially 2.5 MHz.\nFactory board contains sensor + two capacitors.\nConfirm local 10uF from AS5048A VDD3V to GND before power-on." (at 17.78 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d057d21-7918-58c0-acb1-180de3c53700"))
